    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just took a bank loan to start a cotton farm. Grow and sell your cotton to pay off your debt and make money in this clicker incremental game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a short incremental with no prestige mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick and Sell Cotton to gain money</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/144118a5fff17e04fbd4f5411a5a068c.poster.webp?t=1754499716\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/144118a5fff17e04fbd4f5411a5a068c.webp?t=1754499716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=225 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy land to grow more plants</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/842a0a2c057bb38fcfbedfbc1433c55e.poster.webp?t=1754499716\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/842a0a2c057bb38fcfbedfbc1433c55e.webp?t=1754499716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=225 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your farm, gain more money</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/ebf36fcdf90eaf17f8339cebb0b43ab8.poster.webp?t=1754499716\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/ebf36fcdf90eaf17f8339cebb0b43ab8.webp?t=1754499716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=225 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just took a bank loan to start a cotton farm. Grow and sell your cotton to pay off your debt and make money in this clicker incremental game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a short incremental with no prestige mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick and Sell Cotton to gain money</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/144118a5fff17e04fbd4f5411a5a068c.poster.webp?t=1754499716\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/144118a5fff17e04fbd4f5411a5a068c.webp?t=1754499716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=225 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy land to grow more plants</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/842a0a2c057bb38fcfbedfbc1433c55e.poster.webp?t=1754499716\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/842a0a2c057bb38fcfbedfbc1433c55e.webp?t=1754499716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=225 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your farm, gain more money</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/ebf36fcdf90eaf17f8339cebb0b43ab8.poster.webp?t=1754499716\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818980/extras/ebf36fcdf90eaf17f8339cebb0b43ab8.webp?t=1754499716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=225 /></picture></span></p>",
